// WARBURG_SURFACE_TARANTULA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1382806051" "Stay Alert. Enemies are all around."

// WARBURG_SURFACE_TARANTULA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1498717273" "This island is ours!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_TARANTULA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P592404264" "Time to die!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_TARANTULA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P297138413" "Incoming!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_TARANTULA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1990546082" "You shall not wrest this island from our grasp!"

// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3410108277" "Humanoid Anomaly Detected."
// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3421433183" "Execute Search and Destroy order."
// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3499231398" "Invalid Human Parameters Detected."
// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P813352538" "Human/Arachnid Genome Mismatch Detected."

// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P145493461" "Invalid Permissions. Destroy Humanoid Intruder."
// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P401638311" "Attacking Foreign Party."
// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3946139775" "Interloper Detected. Engaging."
// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1079975733" "Engaging Intruder."

// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_GO_ORDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2833898414" "Attacking."
// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_GO_ORDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1728324603" "Go Order Accepted."
// WARBURG_SPIDERLING_SWARM_GO_ORDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1601578224" "Destroying."

// WARBURG_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1235765601" "No entry!"

// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2443258047" "Keep Alert!  Marshal Blitz Will be very angry if this post falls."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2616928794" "Recluse has failed us all with his inactivity.  Marshal Blitz is the future."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2520051402" "Splintering off from Arachnos was the right choice.  All must fall before us!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1492442961" "The secret weapons projects housed below us are the key to a glorious world order."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2983746734" "Lord Recluse was the past, the weakness at Arachnos' core. We will root out such failings."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1039525861" "Forget Recluse and his hesitant schemes. The power is ours now!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3901616448" "Guard this location.  Our former Comrades are weak, but still have some cunning."

// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2809930512" "This island belongs to us, now!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1640785818" "Pick a target, brothers and sisters!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3310842513" "All bets are off!  Fire!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MIXEDGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1350939974" "We will purge this island!"

// WARBURG_SURFACE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P961445630" "Those bold and foolish lambs. It is a sad day when we have to kill them, former brothers that they are."

// WARBURG_SURFACE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2921413558" "More invaders!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1199971470" "Pick your targets!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2597465493" "That one is mine, Brothers!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1912943313" "Weakling invader, time to die!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1230798211" "Suppression incoming!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2791272997" "Suppressing fire!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1294388574" "Go order received. Engage all hostiles."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3816893028" "Engaging hostiles!"

// WARBURG_SURFACE_INSPECTION_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P719139959" "Marshall Blitz has declared this island to be his."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_INSPECTION_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4093686290" "Thugs of Recluse, former Arachnos comrades, and the minions of Longbow.... these are the threats that surround us."

// WARBURG_SURFACE_INSPECTION_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3326326058" "I will take this one down first."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_INSPECTION_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P960685005" "Marshall blitz defends what is his!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_INSPECTION_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1516823427" "Invader!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_INSPECTION_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1031319879" "You will feel the sting of our sacrifices!"

// WARBURG_SURFACE_FORTUNATA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1441884790" "I sense a disturbance."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_FORTUNATA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3844410769" "We must stay strong in our struggle!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_FORTUNATA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4261333537" "Longbow and their minions seek the secrets of this island."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_FORTUNATA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1781597644" "Recluse and our former brothers in Arachnos seek the secrets the island keeps."

// WARBURG_SURFACE_FORTUNATA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1140662361" "Pick your targets, sisters!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_FORTUNATA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1474772097" "Stick close."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_FORTUNATA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2753228637" "Fear the treacherous abyss!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_FORTUNATA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1434686255" "Take down this one first!"

// WARBURG_SURFACE_MU_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P267863964" "I sense a disruption."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MU_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3473517827" "Fail not, my brothers"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_MU_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4212759255" "Defend the island!"

// WARBURG_SURFACE_CRAB_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3913653167" "Splintering off from our Arachnos brothers hurts me, but I see the necessity."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_CRAB_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3808734543" "I loved Recluse, but Marshal Blitz has helped me see they were wrong in their inaction!"
// WARBURG_SURFACE_CRAB_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4243170019" "We are besieged from all sides. Longbow, so-called 'Heroes', Recluse hirelings...even our former Arachnos brothers."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_CRAB_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2171537193" "The rocket here is far too powerful of a weapon to NOT use on Paragon city.  Blitz was right to splinter away from Arachnos."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_CRAB_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1565955341" "My only regret in our little rebellion was the mess that happened down in the WEB below."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_CRAB_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1713282541" "The Arachnoids were a supersoldier project gone wrong.  Let's hope Blitz has better luck with them than Recluse did."
// WARBURG_SURFACE_CRAB_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1821482168" "I grew high in the ranks of Arachnos before I realized the inherent weakness in them all. That is why I am here, defending Blitz and his goals."


// WARBURG_SNIPER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P106535603" "Make those shots count.  Don't waste them."
// WARBURG_SNIPER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2166438664" "One shot.  That's all you need."

// WARBURG_VB_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2599000168" "Those bold and foolish lambs. It is a sad day when we have to kill them, former brothers they are."

// WARBURG_VB_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P237348843" "You do Recluse's work, and for that you will pay."
// WARBURG_VB_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1645050492" "Invaders!"
// WARBURG_VB_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1908165818" "Lambs to the slaughter!"

// WARBURG_MALTA_INVENTORY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1931643106" "I hope the scientific data we exchanged for these Titans was worth it."
// WARBURG_MALTA_INVENTORY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2539180357" "Trading Titans for Arachnos secrets does not sit well with me."
// WARBURG_MALTA_INVENTORY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P770822597" "They paid for an army, they get an army."
// WARBURG_MALTA_INVENTORY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1486390093" "If they are willing to trade for all this firepower, there must be something really sweet to protect on this island."
// WARBURG_MALTA_INVENTORY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P934444026" "All present and accounted for."
// WARBURG_MALTA_INVENTORY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2763546538" "Hey these are brand new!  I thought we were supposed to be peddling surplus to the Rogues."
// WARBURG_MALTA_INVENTORY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1678378582" "We better get paid well for the 'Go' codes on these 'bots."

// WARBURG_MALTA_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1842383853" "Nix the deal! Protect the control chips!"
// WARBURG_MALTA_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1143711702" "Defend the Bots!"
// WARBURG_MALTA_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P148034033" "Heads up.  Drop your tools and fight!"
// WARBURG_MALTA_WELDING_OVERSEER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2306430653" "Deploy turrets, flanking formation!"

// WARBURG_MALTA_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3670431257" "Hurry up and switch the control chips over to Rogue Arachnos."
// WARBURG_MALTA_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3982647953" "The Commander and that Rogue Arachnos are both smiling over this deal.  That makes me really nervous"

// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P747669293" "Okay, your scientific data on the Arachnoids is an acceptable exchange for this army."
// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2249102422" "This load is being configured to be under your control. I trust that more of Recluse's military tech documents are being exchanged?"
// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3194922950" "Okay, same deal as last time? We want the DNA tech on the Arachnoids delivered to the usual contacts."
// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3189737172" "This lot of bots will go a long way to discouraging any action from your former master, Lord Recluse!"
// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2391061046" "Well, my friend... It has been a pleasure doing business with you!"
// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2906811231" "These Titans are our most precious secret.  The information on the Arachnoid Supersoldier Project better be worth this exchange."
// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1458623402" "Too bad you guys lost control of the labs under the city. We would have given you a Kronos Titan for that lab!"

// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1345435416" "What is this treachery?"
// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1824664491" "Deal's on hold until this interloper is done for."
// WARBURG_MALTA_SALESMAN_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3180899407" "Warburg really is a hot zone."

// WARBURG_BOT_HANDLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1199281114" "I mean I'm tough, but these guys... Man!"
// WARBURG_BOT_HANDLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3303264568" "Trading tech and secrets to Malta in exchange for these Titans was so very worth it!"
// WARBURG_BOT_HANDLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1329026910" "Now that we have traded for some of these Titans, even Recluse himself would not be able to take this island back!"

// WARBURG_BOT_HANDLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3202170813" "Get 'em, boys"
// WARBURG_BOT_HANDLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P12761749" "Show me your attack procedures, little robots!"
// WARBURG_BOT_HANDLER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4025239141" "This'll be fun!"

// WARBURG_MALTA_INVENTORY_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1391331117" "Stay Alert.  Enemies are all around."




